# Virtio-net over modern PCI capabilities, with one polled split RX/TX pair.
# References: OpenBSD sys/dev/pv/if_vio.c revision 1.81 (2026-06-23),
# sys/dev/pv/virtio.c revision 1.40 and sys/dev/pci/virtio_pci.c revision 1.54
# (2026-10-11), plus virtioreg.h and virtio_pcireg.h:
# https://github.com/openbsd/src/tree/master/sys/dev/pv
# https://github.com/openbsd/src/tree/master/sys/dev/pci
# Modern-capable transitional and non-transitional network devices only.
# No legacy I/O transport, packed rings, mergeable buffers, offloads or MSI.

